      192.09,
      440.09,
      398.38,
      451.43
    ],
    "text": "to amend the Factories Ordinance (Chapter 128)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      244.39,
      258.43,
      366.67,
      267.5
    ],
    "text": "STATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT",
    "fonts": [
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.47,
      278.47,
      455.5,
      317.9
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2 : This clause repeals paragraph (b) of section 67 of the Factories Ordinance(Chapter 128) (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and the legal effect ofthat section as amended is to broaden the choice of hours which a young person can workwithin a day.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.47,
      328.87,
      455.48,
      348.14
    ],
    "text": "Clause 3 : This clause amends subsection (1) of section 68 of the principal enactmentand legal effect of that section is to avoid repetition of the age of young persons.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.47,
      359.11,
      455.48,
      378.26
    ],
    "text": "Clause 4 : This clause amends subsection (1) of section 71 of the principal enactmentand is consequential to the amendment made by clause 3.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      155.47,
      389.35,
      396.94,
      398.42
    ],
    "text": "Clause 5 : This clause repeals section 77 of the principal enactment.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.47,
      409.39,
      455.49,
      428.54
    ],
    "text": "Clause 6 : This clause amends paragraph (c) of section 86 of the principal enactmentand is consequential to the amendment made by clause 3.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.47,
      439.63,
      455.52,
      468.86
    ],
    "text": "Clause 7 : This clause amends subsection (1) of section 127 of the principal enactmentand the legal effect of that section as amended is to amend the definition of the expression\u201cyoung person\u201d to change the age to be within the ages of sixteen to eighteen years.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      234.57,
      166.97,
      401.69,
      178.31
