      240.95
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE FACTORIES ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 128)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      255.65,
      401.91,
      279.95
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      294.65,
      401.89,
      318.95
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Factories (Amendment)Act, No. of 2020.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      333.65,
      401.92,
      383.99
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 67 of the Factories Ordinance (Chapter 128)(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is herebyamended by the repeal of paragraph (b) and the substitutiontherefor of the following paragraph:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      182.85,
      398.57,
      401.9,
      461.87
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(b) in the case of young persons the period ofemployment shall not exceed twelve hours in anyday and shall neither begin earlier than 6 a.m. norend later than 8 p.m., and on one day in the week,the period of employment shall end by 1 p.m.;\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      476.57,
      401.86,
      500.87
    ],
    "text": "3.Section 68(1) of the principal enactment is herebyamended as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      515.57,
      401.87,
      552.95
    ],
    "text": "(1)by the repeal of the words \u201cwho have attainedsixteen years of age but have not attained eighteenyears of age\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      567.53,
      401.87,
      604.91
    ],
    "text": "(2)in the proviso to that subsection by the repeal of thewords \u201cwho has attained the age of sixteen yearsbut not attained the age of eighteen years,\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      619.61,
      401.88,
      656.87
    ],
    "text": "4.Section 71(1) of the principal enactment is herebyamended in the proviso to that section by the repeal of thewords \u201cwho has attained the age of sixteen\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
